{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "e162bf1c78f1b88295db45320d9abcc0f8a0a0211db2d08203642f3c9b4f97f8", "ja": "ウェイクアップ★アザーサイド", "zh": "唤醒★彼岸", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "66c1530dd50df7796a1c4d37124f597e1d28add3b97f2850a23accbaa8f7c7d9", "ja": "イベントのCMを作ることになり、撮影にや\nってきた一同。風花と莉緒は完成を楽しみに\nしている様子。見学にきた茜は、麗花に振り\n回され疲れてきていた。休憩に入り、いつの\n間にか眠っていた茜が目を覚ますと……？", "zh": "大家决定制作活动宣传片，前来参加拍摄。风花和莉绪似乎很期待成片。前来参观的茜被丽花折腾得开始感到疲惫。休息时，不知不觉睡着的茜醒来后……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b4a3686a1d05eac7c94247cf13e9337619fcc100db9bdc66a0bfc040c477937f", "ja": "（イベント『ハロウィンブラックパーティー』の\nCMを作る事になり、今日はその撮影にやってきた）", "zh": "（决定为活动《万圣节黑色派对》制作广告，今天来这里进行拍摄。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_03_1001_kantoku", "source_sha256": "935619f5a3318553d5074fbfe28a35432fb9d11da3da6f2514fbecd4e9d9b867", "ja": "はい、OKでーす！\n百瀬さん、豊川さん、休憩どうぞ！", "zh": "好的，没问题！\n百濑小姐、丰川小姐，请休息吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_03_1002_041fuk", "source_sha256": "8059bc85c5b0bd0c00bf38b8af220865282a3c943edfc487a8bd300ad4589678", "ja": "はいっ、ありがとうございました！", "zh": "好的，非常感谢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_03_1003_046rio", "source_sha256": "4beff961428cb6f0f971fe9cc37d58955353412b31b7e4ebc453525217d355e8", "ja": "お疲れさまでした♪", "zh": "辛苦了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_03_1004_p", "source_sha256": "cbd81c9461d80a02f140e9096eb967705add7cebb7acb85235d53e7968756005", "ja": "風花、莉緒、お疲れさま。\n調子が良さそうだな。", "zh": "风花、莉绪，辛苦了。\n看起来状态不错啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_03_1005_041fuk", "source_sha256": "0af352452bc61396ab2a0f2ab56c868064d29579907aabfc5031934ec96c2742", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです。\nええ、撮影は順調ですよ♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了。\n嗯，拍摄很顺利哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_03_1006_041fuk", "source_sha256": "3cac9cc098439f88a26a9ae1920ce4d449241e18ce080c533685e8fe07fe8344", "ja": "オバケのパーティって聞いて、怖い雰囲気かと\n思ってたんですけど……にぎやかで楽しいですね！", "zh": "听说是幽灵派对，我还以为会是很恐怖的氛围……没想到热闹又开心呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_03_1007_046rio", "source_sha256": "a152ecca8be376507edbfeda9081b2cef7be80ab51d0954945254fe588d21659", "ja": "私たちのセクシーなオバケで、思いっきり\n盛り上げてきたわよ！　完成が楽しみね、ウフフ♪", "zh": "我们用性感的鬼怪造型，把气氛炒得热热闹闹的！真期待成片出来呢，呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_03_1008_p", "source_sha256": "5e6d603a74aaf7313a5f3fb86517d7c7c099a2de338a7d6294d2345506a3646e", "ja": "そうか。映像チェックを楽しみにしておくよ。\n……あれ、麗花と茜はどこに行ったんだ？", "zh": "这样啊。我就期待看看视频检查吧。\n……咦，丽花和茜去哪儿了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_03_1009_041fuk", "source_sha256": "03201d27461fbef3fb8ad4ca2bdaeecec1725b5ebbb5862ba231036566a3660e", "ja": "さっきまで、そこで見学してくれてましたけど……。\nあっ、あそこで監督さんと話してますね。", "zh": "刚才还在那里参观呢……  \n啊，她们正在那边和导演说话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_03_1010_048rei", "source_sha256": "6a78e257f234b99569090f082fa1514e1b5a17af50c50ec8c43c855ac47564e8", "ja": "ふんふん、なるほど～。じゃあ私たちの撮影は、\nここからびゅーんって飛び降りちゃったらどうですか？", "zh": "嗯嗯，原来如此～。那我们拍摄的时候，从这里嗖地一下跳下去怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_03_1011_kantoku", "source_sha256": "d3a81458e196c620d3cfa12744160462d42c1839b2da25058872a6cf4b6fa41b", "ja": "えっ、飛ぶんですか！？\n結構、高さありますけど……。", "zh": "诶，要飞吗！？\n这个高度可不低啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_03_1012_048rei", "source_sha256": "69bc10b9955814e8e1da38f3c6096eafa70b50f3d910848a9de270bcf0487f1c", "ja": "このくらい大丈夫だよね、茜ちゃん？", "zh": "这么点高度没问题吧，小茜？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_03_1013_023aka", "source_sha256": "0a7efd705328cf033b4f5b4d7770b8bf5f965f0a09ffc04acb0b847f1431e131", "ja": "全然大丈夫じゃないと思うよ、麗花ちゃん！？", "zh": "我觉得完全没问题哦，丽花！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_03_1014_048rei", "source_sha256": "6c43ec0c93e5c282f99d16d4e483bc89fcf3aba091d0156891f27db84aa2a99f", "ja": "うーん……。\n目をつぶって飛べば、きっと怖くないよ！", "zh": "嗯……闭上眼睛飞的话，就一定不会害怕了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_03_1015_023aka", "source_sha256": "edab91848d8ae24dbe8f8a10ad2812f495dcf8dfaca03453c6110089118a56bb", "ja": "いや怖いからね！　あと危ないから！", "zh": "不，还是很可怕的好吧！而且很危险的好吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_03_1016_p", "source_sha256": "76bded575707cb4fb3d3007b39a7db9a97ec3c9b20fe529fddf8022beded18fd", "ja": "撮影に向けて、打ち合わせをしているみたいだな。\n……多分、打ち合わせだと思うけど。", "zh": "为了拍摄，似乎正在开会讨论。\n……不过，我想应该是在开会讨论吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_03_1017_046rio", "source_sha256": "1066d68a77d8f2a0211fce0051f436e8bc9fc6b6470bbf533a6a4f13b69c1261", "ja": "麗花ちゃん、今日も飛ばしてるわね。\nあのバイタリティ、私も見習いたいわ～。", "zh": "丽花今天也干劲十足呢。\n那份活力，我也想好好学习一下～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_03_1018_041fuk", "source_sha256": "c9444e66089b0a707f08fb09de67de77e005accc19882ffab7d101571449d94e", "ja": "それに、ついていってる茜ちゃんもすごいですよね。\n私だったら、麗花ちゃんにつっこみ切れないもの……。", "zh": "而且，能跟得上她的小茜也很厉害呢。要是我的话，可没法一直吐槽丽花……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_03_1019_p", "source_sha256": "b031c860c0bb90e97ad8855d2d73d058b99f96a7a29a544fbe0a84efd58b529b", "ja": "似た者同士のようで、方向性は意外と逆で……\n一周回って、似た者同士ってところかもしれないな。", "zh": "看起来是相似的人，可方向却意外地相反……绕了一圈，说不定还是属于相似的那一类吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_03_1020_p", "source_sha256": "449930099a1c84c33279aab08baf817357dd7aa8487c231c50c4f89306d8c4dc", "ja": "とはいえ、さすがに茜も疲れてきたみたいだな。\n監督、すみませーん！", "zh": "不过话说回来，茜好像也终于累了。\n监督，不好意思——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_03_1022_048rei", "source_sha256": "3bc49bdbc424385f4e7ba8b568026c9387fdb7aec7a2b571cba4f09e93e77b30", "ja": "莉緒さん、風花さん、お疲れさまでした！　おふたりに\n負けないように、私たちもがんばりますね♪", "zh": "莉緒、风花，辛苦了！我们也不能输给你们，要加油哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_03_1023_023aka", "source_sha256": "57826da1af9a958206f01317f4f4b8893e927963d1193c5ca101ea179f836444", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ……まさか、この茜ちゃんが\nツッコミ疲れするとは……恐るべし、麗花ちゃん！", "zh": "哈、哈……没想到连这个小茜都会吐槽到累……丽花真可怕！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_03_1024_p", "source_sha256": "9ae5c4768849a737b808ac4c0fef96c0e9cce21b544edbdac991c75a922a534a", "ja": "茜、だいぶ疲れているみたいだな……。\n反対に、麗花はものすごく元気そうだけど。", "zh": "茜好像已经相当累了……\n反倒是丽花，看起来精神得不得了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_03_1025_048rei", "source_sha256": "8fcffd311f45265530aaa16cb00339d9012d0203f9b6efbd6a1a77ac9443cb86", "ja": "はい、元気です！\n撮影の見学、とっても楽しいですし。", "zh": "是的，我很有精神！\n而且参观拍摄现场特别开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_03_1026_048rei", "source_sha256": "fcf48b3ed96c43943b931aa54581d670c383ea4e7c8b3ba1282ebf61d7235410", "ja": "ハロウィンって楽しいな～。\n毎日がハロウィンでも、いいくらいです♪", "zh": "万圣节真开心啊～。\n就算每天都是万圣节，也没关系呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_03_1027_p", "source_sha256": "8988f7f082f09fd939965dd108c87a8e4885282f234ab15dc84712803a1d161a", "ja": "そ、そうか。……大丈夫か？　茜。", "zh": "是、是吗。……你没事吧，茜？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_03_1028_023aka", "source_sha256": "91e9a769472ac0213bdcfcccf4005f5360da655cd869be04e37bdb1c2443ff0a", "ja": "心配無用だよ、{$P$}ちゃん……。\n麗花ちゃん相手なら、いつものこと……。", "zh": "不用担心啦，{$P$}……。\n对手是丽花的话，这种事很平常……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_03_1029_023aka", "source_sha256": "1dbfaac883b35e34709bc61bb252ab28562bbf415b06ce0bd6bba0b7425cbc67", "ja": "でも、{$P$}ちゃんがどうしてもって\n言うなら……特別に、ナデナデさせてあげてもいいよ？", "zh": "不过，如果{$P$}坚持想要的话……特别让你摸摸头也不是不可以哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_03_1030_p", "source_sha256": "86bbd8d8e68b96e51e1a72a495eedfe14f90609f48b140c2cc9b2ab202770da4", "ja": "わかったわかった。茜が大丈夫なら、\n15分後に打ち合わせ再開だ。頼んだぞ！", "zh": "好啦好啦。只要茜没事，  \n15分钟后就重新开始开会。拜托你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_03_1031_048rei", "source_sha256": "305753501a5466a42e243a8f3d523cf57a80fea908281c91a5b90ee6b2167fad", "ja": "はーいっ！", "zh": "好──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_03_1032_023aka", "source_sha256": "2b2d0c9726c62d4794e4484bae319b59c94619fd2d27ffbee8c5119d8b3b601a", "ja": "はーい！", "zh": "是──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_03_1033_null", "source_sha256": "8679b00349ee52ac9275cbc3ef9f2fe6aca2775f7c39ca12ff8f1eba9fa928b6", "ja": "15分後……", "zh": "15分钟后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_03_1034_048rei", "source_sha256": "21602ff1c2f9cc30e2d28d8ffb401c3b02242ffc9998892f58c196a8117d85de", "ja": "……ちゃん。起きて……茜ちゃん。", "zh": "……小姐。醒醒……小茜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_03_1035_023aka", "source_sha256": "396b61c7aa835410ba9b50251adc82e06e30b88e63fa2f43e792965c701ebf6e", "ja": "……はっ！？", "zh": "……啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_03_1036_023aka", "source_sha256": "a8228bc555d589e0fa252d9219a9ee1f6d57b7ac9a8c79f312346924d2727059", "ja": "あ、あれ、もう休憩終わり？\nていうか茜ちゃん、寝ちゃってた？", "zh": "啊、啊咧，休息已经结束了吗？\n话说回来，小茜，你刚才睡着了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_03_1037_048rei", "source_sha256": "36dfb2d12a0dc4ec277df3d7b9231f280072b9473e137672b2e69bcc91e67812", "ja": "……おはよう、茜ちゃん。", "zh": "……早上好，小茜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_03_1038_023aka", "source_sha256": "4cf22a614b61eb3465bb0d94659e0ae14ff56d1230cce00a6511c6dc8c3becc0", "ja": "お、おはよう、麗花ちゃん。茜ちゃんとしたことが、\nうっかり寝ちゃってたよ。疲れてたのかな……。", "zh": "早、早上好，丽花。没想到小茜居然一不小心睡着了。是太累了吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_03_1039_023aka", "source_sha256": "8bbf2b757e133b8fe95341472229c2bc7a1437ee11f433091a9cce9f0b5a8a33", "ja": "いやいや、茜ちゃんは大丈夫！\nお待たせしました！　茜ちゃんふっかー……つ……。", "zh": "不不，小茜完全没事！\n让你们久等啦！小茜复活——……咦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_03_1040_023aka", "source_sha256": "d092b74e19549671d55871f7c5eed5785dee2d5206488a2a22cdf6399401d499", "ja": "あ、あれっ？\n……こんなセット、あったっけ？", "zh": "啊，咦？\n……之前有这样的布景吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_03_1041_048rei", "source_sha256": "1ec5400863ad9c20aaf0712fd3c8f81a89fda7197bbd3592974b59da1e949d12", "ja": "ううん、これはセットじゃないよ。\nとっても綺麗でしょ？", "zh": "不，这不是布景哦。\n很漂亮吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_03_1042_048rei", "source_sha256": "3f12c4c11a37eb5f953a32f2e434581485681adc286deaa1b105351a193745dd", "ja": "よく来たね、茜ちゃん。\nさぁ、こっちに来て？", "zh": "你来啦，小茜。\n来，到这边来嘛？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0156_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0156_story_03_1043_023aka", "source_sha256": "48a4a827a062bd12c38b80c867836984442e842aac5bbc648f90805e7b0c6f16", "ja": "こっちって……あれ？\n他のみんなは……？", "zh": "你说这边……咦？\n其他人呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
